  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced (see Kitchen hack). Thinly slice the onion. Finely chop the tomato. Slice the haloumi. Combine half the Italian seasoning and 2 tsp olive oil in a large bowl and season with pepper. Add the haloumi and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150326/photos/large/64936_1-e1ff4cca51a18016d2e579e5383ad727.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tortillas: Enclose the tortillas in foil. Put in the oven for 8 mins or until softened and warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150327/photos/large/64936_2-c136a4205648c6d7b8ed79370331e817.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sweet onion: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Cook the onion, stirring occasionally, for 5 mins or until soft. Add 2 tsp balsamic vinegar and 1 tsp sugar and stir to combine. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150328/photos/large/64936_3-37255f2a2b7f12ea4a20bed2394fcff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook haloumi: Return the pan to medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 2 mins each side or until golden. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150329/photos/large/64936_4-7ee306cf1cd198e14be8ada2f876eb03.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the tortillas among plates. Top with the spinach, haloumi, tomato and onion. Drizzle with the mayonnaise, then fold over to enclose the filling. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150330/photos/large/64936_5-1a817794116ea2b5ffd44e1d5c433563.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen hack: Don't want to turn on the oven? Put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2150331/photos/large/64936_6-bab28b3dbc9e593c21bb67948f25c2be.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
